// End-to-End E19.1 LSP Server, CompilerDB IDE Engine, AXEDITOR & AXCODEEDITOR Conformance Probe (T803)
// Exercises live `std.editor` + `compiler.query.db` + `compiler.lsp.protocol`
// + `compiler.lsp.vfs` + `compiler.lsp.handlers` + `compiler.driver.lsp_cmd`
// across `--interp` and native `-O0` compilation.

